rue] [17592186420092 1074 "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the 1st component ${e}^{-t}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 2nd component $\\frac{1}{t}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,0)\\cup (0,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 3rd component $\\operatorname{ln}⁡(t+1)$ is $t\\in (-1,\\infty ).$\n\nThe intersection is illustrated in the diagram below.\n\n![](images/a5/a55ef2c927b26c9beba9b44f669c817cf749b79de163b4bf0505d15c6ec31630.png)\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is $t\\in (-1,0)\\cup (0,\\infty ).$" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1068 #edb/ref 17592186420091 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1069 "q-162647" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1071 "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=\\operatorname{sec}⁡(t+\\frac{\\pi }{4})\\,i+{e}^{t-1}\\,j+{t}^{2}\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne .\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer." 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1072 #uuid "b8302ddf-29cf-570b-b7dd-dab545b3b824" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420093 1074 "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the 1st component $\\operatorname{sec}⁡(t+\\frac{\\pi }{4})$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ except for the values of $t$ for which\n\n$$\nt+\\frac{\\pi }{4}=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi n\\,⟹\\,t=\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi n,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The domain of the 2nd component ${e}^{t-1}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 3rd component ${t}^{2}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi n,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420094 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420098 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420094 1062 #uuid "0dbe3293-2708-527b-b605-9fe12b6e37f9" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420094 1063 #edb/ref 17592186420093 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420095 1062 #uuid "69b7e384-7af7-55ae-bcb8-73eecb04e14a" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420095 1063 #edb/ref 17592186420092 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420096 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420097 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420096 1062 #uuid "743b0666-1b94-5795-b0db-227efb4df31d" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420096 1063 #edb/ref 17592186115513 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420097 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420094 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420097 1062 #uuid "85c58b22-fe0d-57c2-b692-2346cf29a3ec" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420097 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281514 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420098 1058 #edb/ref 17592186420095 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420098 1062 #uuid "e7ce2d54-5c14-540f-93a3-4a8f924d9288" 13194139534353 17592186045417 true] [17592186420098 1063 #edb/ref 17592186281522 13194139534353 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-d63840d2-3609-5c32-bdc9-4fe9ce0a42cd" 17592186420079 "answer-1000e325-da05-5f3a-9e1d-24312518777d" 17592186420080 "answer-2478ad2d-b6eb-59d1-b76b-abe7a69ec247" 17592186420081 "answer-54811e57-5329-5901-9031-55945bdb3aaf" 17592186420082 "answer-656b42d3-126c-5abb-9880-9e0fc6a9e621" 17592186420083 "answer-691ebfd7-4000-5575-996f-d102ad66730b" 17592186420084 "answer-6d5d9399-1eaf-57c4-b24e-dd1b89bcd1e1" 17592186420085 "answer-94b764b3-edc6-585d-9049-19b093287871" 17592186420086 "answer-976cc8f2-04f3-53c2-a86c-c645ed2fbec5" 17592186420087 "answer-b312f764-3451-5f4e-9cfb-871263b18b8d" 17592186420088 "answer-da650f9b-762e-5944-b6e9-28cdf4865151" 17592186420089 "answer-field-